window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Two years of my life have been stolen by the Royals of Forsyth. Two years of captivity and hell. Two years at the whim of powerful men.</p> <p>I spent that time seeking freedom.</p> <p>Now, I want nothing more than revenge.</p> <p>It won’t be easy. It’ll be painful and humiliating, but in the end, taking down the thugs and thieves and criminals terrorizing Forsyth will be worth it.</p> <p>I just have to decide who to go after first.</p> <p><i>Dukes of Madness</i> is the fifth audiobook in the contemporary dark romance <i>Royals of Forsyth U</i> series by best-selling authors Angel Lawson and Samantha Rue.</p> <p><b>Listening Order:</b></p> <p><i>Lords of Pain</i></p> <p><i>Lords of Wrath</i></p> <p><i>Lords of Mercy</i></p> <p><i>Dukes of Ruin</i></p> <p><i>Dukes of Madness</i></p>"; 
